      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "AMENDMENTS TO THE REAL PROPERTY GAINS TAX ACT 1976 Commencement of amendments to the Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_23",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "23",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_23__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_23__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_23__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_23",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sections 24 and 27 come into operation on the coming into operation of this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_23__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_23",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sections 25 and 26 are deemed to have come into operation on 12 October 2019. Amendment of section 21b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_24",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "24",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Real Property Gains Tax Act 1976, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Chapter, is amended in subsection 21b(1A) by substituting for the words “not a citizen and not a permanent resident” the words “not a citizen, not a permanent resident or not a company incorporated in Malaysia”. Amendment of Schedule 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_25",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "25",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Schedule 2 to the principal Act is amended in paragraph 2A by substituting for the words “1 January 2000” the words “1 January 2013”. Amendment of Schedule 3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_26",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Schedule 3 to the principal Act is amended in subparagraph 13(2) by substituting for the words “1 January 2000” wherever appearing the words “1 January 2013”. Amendment of Schedule 5"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_27",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "27",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_27__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_27__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Schedule 5 to the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_27__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_27",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in Part II, by inserting after the word “company” the words “incorporated in Malaysia or a trustee of a trust”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_27__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_III__cl_27",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in Part III, by inserting after the words “or an executor of the estate of a deceased person who is not a citizen and not a permanent resident” the words “, or a company not incorporated in Malaysia”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_II__cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 74(4) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “subsection 103(3), (4), (5), (6), (7) or (8)” the words “subsection 103(3), (5) or (7)”. Amendment of section 77b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_II__cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 77b of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (4) the following subsection: “(4) The tax or additional tax payable under subsection (1) shall be increased by a sum equal to ten per cent of the amount of such tax or additional tax.”. Amendment of section 91"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_II__cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 91 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (6) the following subsection: “(7) Notwithstanding subsections (1) and (5), the Director General may at any time make an assessment or additional assessment, as the case may be, for a year of assessment in respect of a person, in the amount or additional amount of chargeable income and tax, in consequence of a mutual agreement procedure in the double taxation arrangement effected under section 132.”. Amendment of section 96"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_II__cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subparagraph 96(4)(c)(ii) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “subsection 103(5), (6), (7) or (8)” the words “subsection 103(5) or (7)”. Amendment of section 100"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_II__cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_II",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 100 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1) A person seeking to appeal against an assessment after the expiration of the period to make an appeal under subsection 99(1), may within seven years after the end of that period, make to the Director General a written application in the prescribed form for an extension of that period within which a notice of appeal against that assessment may be given under that subsection.”. Amendment of section 103"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_II__cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
