      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsections (3), (4), (5) and (6), by substituting for the word “Minister” the words “Director General”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_II__cl_19__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_II__cl_19",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (6) the following subsection: “(6A) Any person aggrieved by the decision of the Director General in respect of— (a) refusal to grant a renewal of an approval; or (b) revocation of an approval, may, within one month from the date on which such decision is notified to him, make an appeal in writing to the Minister, whose decision shall be final.”. Amendment of Schedule 1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_II__cl_20",
