      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "no estimate is furnished by a company, trust body or co-operative society and no direction is given by the Director General to make payment by instalment under subsection (8);"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_VII__cl_39__list_4__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_VII__cl_39__list_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "no prosecution under section 120 has been instituted in relation to failure to furnish such estimate; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_VII__cl_39__list_4__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/33/eng@/~chp_VII__cl_39__list_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "tax is payable by that company, trust body or co-operative society pursuant to an assessment for that year of assessment, such tax payable shall without any further notice being served be increased by a sum equal to ten per cent of the tax payable and that sum shall be recoverable as if it were tax due and payable under this Act: Provided that if that company, trust body or co-operative society pays that sum or, where the sum is remitted under subsection (11), that company, trust body or co-operative society shall not be liable to be charged on the same facts with an offence under section 120.”; and"
      }
    },
    {
